&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;#45&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Yesod&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Item has been integrated into the Foundation&#039;s command structure&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;D. Asheworth&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: green&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accepted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
