&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;Please submit your proposals here:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-0110-j/html/dbfbd5f88918a1bc6d7ac3a81d99217f1d60bedd-5822042891557641281&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;html-block-iframe&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#f2f2c2; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION RECORDS AND INFORMATION SECURITY ADMINISTRATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What the fuck is wrong with you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
I&#039;m away for a month-long vacation - I should also mention it&#039;s the first in literally decades - and I come up back to forty-five new Object Classes. Are any of you even aware of how much paperwork that creates? Hell, even one new Object Class creates weeks of new documents to fill, but forty-five? Most of them aren&#039;t even usable! You are literally just clogging the database for the purpose of sounding ~cool~ or your documentation getting more attention due to a word at the top of it. Yesod is practically a Thaumiel, the watchman except will less uses! And what the hell even is &lt;em&gt;Chhokmah&lt;/em&gt;? I don’t care there’s a -K goddamnit, you guys can literally remake the universe, so find a way around that shit.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8212; Maria Jones, Director, RAISA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;display: block; border : dashed 1px #444444 ; background :#f5f5f5; margin-left : auto ; margin-right : auto ; width : auto ; padding:10px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re: What the fuck is wrong with you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chhokmah balls&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#f2f2c2; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re: Re: What the fuck is wrong with you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That’s not funny. What the hell is Maksur then?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;display: block; border : dashed 1px #444444 ; background :#f5f5f5; margin-left : auto ; margin-right : auto ; width : auto ; padding:10px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Re: Re: Re: What the fuck is wrong with you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maksur to Chhokmah balls&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#f2f2c2; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I’m going on another vacation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608625916&quot; alt=&quot;Ralliston&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston&quot;  &gt;Ralliston&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-595722-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. As long as they adhere to the purpose of such an allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-595722-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Hereby referred to as SCP-0110-PRIME-J.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-595722-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Comment: Technically, we can also make typos in already existing classes and call them &amp;quot;upgraded&amp;quot; versions of the old ones.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-595722-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Comment: We understand what you&#039;re trying to do here Ethan and we appreciate the good will, but unfortunately it doesn&#039;t work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
