&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/boogey-man23-author-page/html/6f0ad53ad8d15c1222fecbe0221ba0e3a753e601-142843874865624941&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;html-block-iframe&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP voice-acting by me. Audio edited by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chrisakapiefish&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1578588&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608625916&quot; alt=&quot;ChrisAKAPiefish&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1578588)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chrisakapiefish&quot;  &gt;ChrisAKAPiefish&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP Idea: The Reverse-Chicken. So instead of a chicken that lays eggs, it&#039;s an egg that hatches into&amp;#8230; oh.. never mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There once was a Redd fire truck,&lt;br /&gt;
That came to life by some luck,&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-4601,&lt;br /&gt;
He went on the run,&lt;br /&gt;
And the Foundation said &amp;quot;Oh f- uhh, that sucks.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dear B_Man,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In certain articles, I see reality benders being referred to as &amp;quot;bixbies&amp;quot;. Can you explain this nickname?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bill Bixby was an actor, perhaps best known for his role playing Dr. David Banner on the television series &lt;em&gt;The Incredible Hulk&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On that show, the Dr. Banner character would, in times of anger or stress, transform into the Hulk; a powerful green creature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a way, a Type Green Reality Bender might also be categorized as a powerful green creature; just like the Incredible Hulk, who was actually Dr. Banner, who was played by Bill Bixby.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hence the reason why Reality Benders / Type Greens are called by the vernacular &amp;quot;Bixbies&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boogey-man23&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2362395&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608625916&quot; alt=&quot;Boogey_Man23&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2362395)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boogey-man23&quot;  &gt;Boogey_Man23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
