&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-516687-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Individual was identified as Malcolm Stevenson, a freelance mobile application developer with possible connections into several Groups of Interest (GoI&#039;s) including &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/are-we-cool-yet-hub&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Are We Cool Yet?&amp;quot;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/gamers-against-weed-hub&quot;&gt;Gamers Against Weed&lt;/a&gt;, and had even possessed an active account on the popular forum website &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/parawatch-hub&quot;&gt;Parawatch.net&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
