						 <p><strong>Name:</strong> Westrin</p> <p><strong>Security Clearance:</strong> Fluctuating</p> <p><strong>Duties:</strong> Standing here within the sea of static</p> <p><strong>Site of Operations:</strong> Site-551</p> <p><strong>Rating Module:</strong></p> <p><strong>Profile:</strong> Dr. Westrin is a concept. Reports state that Dr. Westrin is a living being that has helped with several SCPs and SCP reports. Others report that Dr. Westrin never existed, and his name just appeared within the database abruptly. Whatever is the case, the O5 Council has determined that Dr. Westrin serves a purpose, and his continued existence is required for the continued existence of the Foundation and its doctors.</p> <p>He thinks he's good at writing SCP reports, this is yet to be determined.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">CODENAME:&nbsp;Westrin's&nbsp;SCP&nbsp;Reports</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">SECURITY&nbsp;MEMETIC:&nbsp;Apollyon&nbsp;is&nbsp;my&nbsp;favorite&nbsp;object&nbsp;class</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>SCPs:</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3761">SCP-3761</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1831">SCP-1831</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4050">SCP-4050</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4991">SCP-4991</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fishingenthusiast" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4364963&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="fishingenthusiast" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4364963)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fishingenthusiast" >fishingenthusiast</a></span>)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4135">SCP-4135</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3748">SCP-3748</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4335">SCP-4335</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4521">SCP-4521</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3657">SCP-3657</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4559">SCP-4559</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4098">SCP-4098</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190300&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="Henzoid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190300)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" >Henzoid</a></span>)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4885">SCP-4885</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4831">SCP-4831</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4932">SCP-4932</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1926">SCP-1926</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="RJB_R" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r" >RJB_R</a></span>)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5899">SCP-5899</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5991">SCP-5991</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5045">SCP-5045</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pastarasta1" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2551139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="pastarasta1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2551139)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pastarasta1" >pastarasta1</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/validclay" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4538622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="ValidClay" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4538622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/validclay" >ValidClay</a></span>)</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">CODENAME:&nbsp;Westrin's&nbsp;Reports&nbsp;and&nbsp;Miscellaneous&nbsp;Documents</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">SECURITY&nbsp;MEMETIC:&nbsp;We&nbsp;don't&nbsp;have&nbsp;enough&nbsp;meta&nbsp;SCPs</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>Tales (&amp; Others):</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.wikidot.com/fifthbobpentapants">Patrick Star Becomes Enlightened</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.wikidot.com/broken-masquerade-epistolary">Snippets of an Unveiled World</a> (with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span>,&nbsp;<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ifbench" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3227499&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="IFBench" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3227499)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ifbench" >IFBench</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3988532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="Deadly Bread" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3988532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" >Deadly Bread</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nykacolaquantum" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5187906&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="Nykacolaquantum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5187906)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nykacolaquantum" >Nykacolaquantum</a></span>)</li> </ul> <hr /> <p><strong>Miscellaneous:</strong></p> <ul> <li>I created the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/t-2116184">Log of Anomalous Items challenge.</a> The hub can be found <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ao-hub">here.</a></li> </ul> <ul> <li>I created the character of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3309">Researcher Smalls</a>, as well as came up with the idea to use a forum in 3309.</li> </ul> <ul> <li>I named <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5999">SCP-5999</a>, though that's not really that much of an accomplishment considering it's a phrase that's repeated like 20 times in the article itself.</li> </ul> <ul> <li>I contributed to <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-wow-j">this monstrosity</a>.</li> </ul> <ul> <li>I also have a sandbox where I work on shit. <a href="http://smlt.wikidot.com/westrin:bighub">Here you can find links to all my current projects.</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">CODENAME:&nbsp;Westrin's&nbsp;Dead&nbsp;Man's&nbsp;Switch</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">SECURITY&nbsp;MEMETIC:&nbsp;Honestly,&nbsp;TF2&nbsp;is&nbsp;just&nbsp;an&nbsp;Overwatch&nbsp;clone.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>Licensing:</strong></p> <p>All my SCPs can be merchandised however anyone pleases. However, be cautious with SCP-4335, as I do not know the specifics of Mojang's mechanizing policies :P. <strong>Remember to credit me.</strong></p> <hr /> <p>In the event that I ever</p> <ul> <li>leave the site and go do something productive forever</li> </ul> <ul> <li>go on a hiatus or something</li> </ul> <ul> <li>horribly die</li> </ul> <ul> <li>peacefully die</li> </ul> <p>I entrust all my articles/future articles to both <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608625921" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi