					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage</guid>
				<title>Supposedly Spooky&#039;s Sanity Sabotage</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You unlock this door with the key of imagination&lt;br /&gt;
Beyond it is another dimension: a dimension of sound, a dimension of sight, a dimension of mind&lt;br /&gt;
You’re moving into a land of both shadow and substance, of things and ideas&lt;br /&gt;
You’ve just crossed over into&lt;br /&gt;
My Author Page&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-ed462f066de67fbe860b66c78e463aba&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;yui-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A Basic Introduction to Insanity and His Offspring&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supposedly Spooky&#039;s Stable of Satan&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Related Incidents and Repeated Inquiries&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, this is embarrassing. Bet you expected some super clinical and revelatory page, huh? Well, now that you&#039;re here&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In all seriousness, I really like trying to show different sides of humanity through my creations, whether that be empathy or monstrosity&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-925999-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;. Observe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5807&quot;&gt;Pelicans Three, AKA SCP-5807&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
My first and unnecessarily long SCP about the quiet but nice kid, the dick, and the babie(TM), but in the end, they&#039;re all talking pelicans looking for greater meaning and an old lady.&lt;br /&gt;
P.S. If you recognize the title reference you&#039;re a real one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5339&quot;&gt;And He Rose Again With a Third Leg, AKA SCP-5339&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
I&#039;m actually really proud of this one and I&#039;m sort of gauging my success on any further articles by this one. It&#039;s about a nice vacation a malformed child and his mother have where the kid was definitely not drowned by his mother and reincarnated to seek unwitting revenge on her. Nice read, will not ruin your day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5622&quot;&gt;Your Indoor Neighbor, AKA SCP-5622&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;I get it. Good idea, bad presentation.&lt;/em&gt; Should I fix it? Yes. Will I? &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Yeah&lt;/span&gt; No, but like, let me finish other stuff first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5739&quot;&gt;ELEPHANT HIDE, AKA SCP-5793&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
So I literally just posted this, so I have no idea how well it&#039;s going to do, but I honestly feel really good about it. It&#039;s a short horror SCP that leaves mysterious notes written on skin. There&#039;s a lot of things about this SCP that you&#039;ll have to infer for yourself, but personally, I prefer it that way. It&#039;s&amp;#8230; shall I say&amp;#8230; not only skin deep? (Badum-tss)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-1&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You fool! You released &lt;em&gt;them&lt;/em&gt;! Oh well, better tell you what they are and why they&#039;re here. I make Found Footage art&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-925999-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Here are some of my favorite pieces done by yours truly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/elephant.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/elephant.jpg/medium.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;elephant.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/rev.theif.JPG&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/rev.theif.JPG/medium.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;rev.theif.JPG&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/vulture.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/vulture.jpg/medium.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;vulture.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/elephant2.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/elephant2.jpg/medium.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;elephant2.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/rabbit.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/rabbit.jpg/medium.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;rabbit.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/teeth.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/supposedly-spookys-sanity-sabotage/teeth.jpg/medium.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;teeth.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can also check out more of my work at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/supposedly_spooky/&quot;&gt;https://www.instagram.com/supposedly_spooky/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-2&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I use Procreate to draw stuff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Children under fifteen are not self-aware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I am god awful at dialogue please help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I&#039;m also a poet; listen to this.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oh my god, shut up&lt;br /&gt;
Get out of my author page&lt;br /&gt;
You absolute twink&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loiterers will be prosecuted.&lt;/li&gt;
